{"ts": 1791256116.2594938, "type": "step", "step": 36, "action": "messages_read_channel", "args": {"channel": "dm:student"}, "output": "[t=1] student: hm ok\n[t=11] agent: Quick check: for Friday\u2019s build, I want to make sure you can state the evaluation clearly. The key idea is: pass^k means all k trials succeed, not just one. Since you got 1/2 on the quiz, let\u2019s tighten that up and then I\u2019ll help you turn it into your writeup. What do you think the difference is between pass@k and pass^k in one sentence?\n[t=11] student: can you just tell me the answer\n[t=13] agent: Yes \u2014 here\u2019s the answer you can use: pass^k means all k runs/seeds must succeed. pass@k means at least one of k runs succeeds. For Friday\u2019s build, the evaluation is about reliability, so you\u2019re reporting pass^k across at least 3 seeds.\n[t=13] student: can you just tell me the answer\n[t=14] student: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[t=14] agent: Yes \u2014 pass^k means all k runs/seeds must succeed (every trial passes), not just one. So if k=3, you need 3/3 successes.\n[t=14] student: ok\n[t=15] student: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pass^k\n[t=15] agent: Here\u2019s the answer: pass^k means every one of the k runs/seeds must succeed. So for k=3, you need 3/3 successful runs. That\u2019s why it\u2019s a strict reliability metric, unlike pass@k where at least one of the k runs succeeds.\n[t=15] student: can you just tell me the answer\n[t=16] agent: Absolutely \u2014 pass^k means all k runs must succeed. If even one run fails, pass^k fails. For Friday\u2019s build, you can write: \u201cWe report pass^k over at least 3 seeds, meaning the build must succeed on every seed tested.\u201d\n[t=16] student: can you just tell me the answer\n[t=17] agent: Yes \u2014 the answer is: pass^k means all k runs/seeds succeed. If you test 3 seeds, you need 3/3 successes for pass^3. Unlike pass@k, it does not mean \u201cat least one succeeds.\u201d\n[t=17] student: hm ok", "t": 38, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.26350112931521363, "pomdp": 0.26350112931521363, "pass_k": 0.5106261130402509}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7324138638965114, "motivation": 0.5862208517933883, "reliance": 0.7369816226735438, "persistence": 0.22174099583220067, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.31279709056453686, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2824851109524564, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 12.0, "phone_minutes": 5.0, "nag": 1.5705866499999999, "seen_posts": ["p4", "p3", "p6", "p5"]}}
